## Approach 3: Optimized Solution (Mathematical Range Checking)

```python
class Solution:
    def canAliceWin(self, n: int) -> bool:
        return (
            10 <= n < 19 or
            27 <= n < 34 or
            40 <= n < 45 or
            49 <= n <= 50
        )
```

### Complexity Analysis
- Time Complexity: O(1)
- Space Complexity: O(1)

